# Release signing key material - never commit these. Both naming generations
# are listed so a local copy under either name stays ignored.
# The matching public key (theqrl-release-key.pub) is committed on purpose.
/qrlft-release-key
/qrlft-release-key.private.hexseed
/theqrl-release-key
/theqrl-release-key.private.hexseed
